{"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@E@MLNOfflinePackState@MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","title":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"}]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"It is unknown whether the pack is inactive, active, or complete."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackState\/MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinepackstate\/mlnofflinepackstateunknown"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNOfflinePackStateUnknown"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the initial state of a pack. The state of a pack becomes known by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the time the shared "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object sends the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePackProgressChangedNotification","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" about the pack. For inactive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"packs, you must explicitly request a progress update using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack\/requestProgress","